2026-07-27T07:54:15.1368380Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1368883Z i /tmp/Rtmpi3gljL/duckdb
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1369200Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1369831Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1370355Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1370863Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1371562Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1372328Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1600483Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:15.1702634Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:15.2131389Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T07:54:15.2297558Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
